are on our \u003Ca href=\"/betting-tips\">betting tips\u003C/a> page, and you can find \u003Ca href=\"/betting-tips/Rugby_League/10\">Rugby League tips\u003C/a> too. To see how the leading competitions compare, jump to our \u003Ca href=\"#rugby-union-betting-stats-premiership-top-14-super-rugby-and-urc\">Rugby Union betting stats\u003C/a>.\u003C/p>","Categories or Leagues",[28,32,38,44,49,55,61,67,72,77,82,88,94,100,106,111,115,121,126,132],{"title":29,"url":30,"type":31},"All Sports","/betting-tips","sport",{"title":33,"url":34,"type":31,"breadcrumbIdx":35,"rank":36,"items":-1,"sportId":23,"hasItems":37},"Horse Racing","/betting-tips/Horse_Racing/2","betting-tips-Horse_Racing","1",true,{"title":39,"url":40,"type":31,"breadcrumbIdx":41,"rank":42,"items":-1,"sportId":43,"hasItems":37},"Football","/betting-tips/Football/1","betting-tips-Football","2",1,{"title":45,"url":46,"type":31,"breadcrumbIdx":47,"rank":48,"items":-1,"sportId":20,"hasItems":37},"Tennis","/betting-tips/Tennis/3","betting-tips-Tennis","3",{"title":50,"url":51,"type":31,"breadcrumbIdx":52,"rank":53,"items":-1,"sportId":54,"hasItems":37},"Cricket","/betting-tips/Cricket/7","betting-tips-Cricket","4",7,{"title":56,"url":57,"type":31,"breadcrumbIdx":58,"rank":59,"items":-1,"sportId":60,"hasItems":37},"Greyhounds","/betting-tips/Greyhounds/28","betting-tips-Greyhounds","6",28,{"title":62,"url":63,"type":31,"breadcrumbIdx":64,"rank":65,"items":-1,"sportId":66,"hasItems":37},"Basketball","/betting-tips/Basketball/4","betting-tips-Basketball","7",4,{"title":68,"url":69,"type":31,"breadcrumbIdx":70,"rank":65,"items":-1,"sportId":71,"hasItems":37},"American Football","/betting-tips/American_Football/11","betting-tips-American_Football",11,{"title":73,"url":74,"type":31,"breadcrumbIdx":75,"rank":65,"items":-1,"sportId":76,"hasItems":37},"Baseball","/betting-tips/Baseball/12","betting-tips-Baseball",12,{"title":78,"url":79,"type":31,"breadcrumbIdx":80,"rank":65,"items":-1,"sportId":81,"hasItems":37},"Ice Hockey","/betting-tips/Ice_Hockey/13","betting-tips-Ice_Hockey",13,{"title":83,"url":84,"type":31,"breadcrumbIdx":85,"rank":86,"items":-1,"sportId":87,"hasItems":37},"Boxing","/betting-tips/Boxing/16","betting-tips-Boxing","9",16,{"title":89,"url":90,"type":31,"breadcrumbIdx":91,"rank":92,"sportId":93,"items":-1,"hasItems":-1},"Snooker","/betting-tips/Snooker/8","betting-tips-Snooker","10",8,{"title":95,"url":96,"type":31,"breadcrumbIdx":97,"rank":98,"items":-1,"sportId":99,"hasItems":37},"Motor Racing","/betting-tips/Motor_Racing/14","betting-tips-Motor_Racing","11",14,{"title":101,"url":102,"type":31,"breadcrumbIdx":103,"rank":104,"items":-1,"sportId":105,"hasItems":37},"Darts","/betting-tips/Darts/15","betting-tips-Darts","12",15,{"title":107,"url":108,"type":31,"breadcrumbIdx":109,"rank":110,"items":-1,"sportId":19,"hasItems":37},"Rugby Union","/betting-tips/Rugby_Union/9","betting-tips-Rugby_Union","14",{"title":112,"url":113,"type":31,"breadcrumbIdx":114,"rank":110,"items":-1,"sportId":21,"hasItems":37},"Rugby League","/betting-tips/Rugby_League/10","betting-tips-Rugby_League",{"title":116,"url":117,"type":31,"breadcrumbIdx":118,"rank":119,"items":-1,"sportId":120,"hasItems":37},"Gaelic Football","/betting-tips/Gaelic_Football/25","betting-tips-Gaelic_Football","20",25,{"title":122,"url":123,"type":31,"breadcrumbIdx":124,"rank":119,"items":-1,"sportId":125,"hasItems":37},"Hurling","/betting-tips/Hurling/26","betting-tips-Hurling",26,{"title":127,"url":128,"type":31,"breadcrumbIdx":129,"rank":130,"items":-1,"sportId":131,"hasItems":37},"Handball","/betting-tips/Handball/20","betting-tips-Handball","49",20,{"title":133,"url":134,"type":31,"breadcrumbIdx":135,"rank":136,"items":-1,"sportId":137,"hasItems":37},"Volleyball","/betting-tips/Volleyball/21","betting-tips-Volleyball","50",21,[139],{"title":107,"url":108,"type":31,"breadcrumbIdx":109,"parentSport":19},["Map",141,-1,142,-1],"tips-header","site-takeover",{"sportId":86,"sportName":144,"categoryName":16,"leagueName":16,"eventName":16,"limit":131},"Rugby_Union","eba0ff68dd4fda32c96e5d03fb71c5151792991995416:ouk:google-chrome:unknown:126.0.0.0","D",{"take_over_banners":48,"take_over_banners_position_fixed":36,"start":148,"end":149,"_cachedAt":150,"_cacheKey":151,"_flushedByIp":152},"2023-09-11 13:38:19","2026-10-31 08:37:03","2026-10-26T05:10:06.917Z","takeover-banners-settings","10.182.96.9",[154],{"slug":155,"location_id":156},"in-events-list","L1",false,{"content":159},{"sections":160},[161,164,167,170,173,176,179],{"title":162,"sections_content":163},"About Our Rugby Union Betting Tips and Predictions","\u003Cp>This page brings together OLBG's Rugby Union tips and predictions for today's and upcoming matches, along with ante-post picks for the major tournaments. Our tipsters post match winner and handicap selections and explain their reasoning in their comments, so you can judge each tip for yourself.\u003C/p>\u003Ch3>Rugby Union Competitions Our Tipsters Cover\u003C/h3>\u003Cp>Our tipsters post Rugby Union betting tips for the leading club competitions, including the Premiership, United Rugby Championship, Top 14, Super Rugby Pacific, Currie Cup, European Champions Cup and European Challenge Cup. On the international scene, you'll find Six Nations tips and Rugby World Cup predictions, with season-long and ante-post best bets added where our tipsters have them.\u003C/p>\u003Ch3>How to Read the Rugby Union Tips Table\u003C/h3>\u003Cp>Each row in the table above covers one selection. These are the columns:\u003C/p>\u003Ctable class=\"table no-branding\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\u003Cthead>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"col\">Column\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\">What it shows\u003C/th>\u003C/tr>\u003C/thead>\u003Ctbody>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Events\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>The match or tournament the tip is for.\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Selection\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>The tip itself, such as a team to win or a handicap line.\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Odds\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>The bookmaker odds for that selection.\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Tips &amp; Comments\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>The share of tips placed on the selection within that market, plus the tipsters' comments explaining their picks.\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Value Rating\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>A comparison of the selection's odds with its theoretical probability of winning, based on the percentage of tips for it.\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Add\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Adds the selection to your betslip.\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003C/tbody>\u003C/table>\u003Cp>You can re-order the Rugby Union predictions to suit you by using the sort arrows in the column headings, for example by event, by odds, by the most popular tip or by value rating.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>Once you've chosen your selections, compare bookmakers' odds before you place your bet. Please gamble responsibly and only bet what you can afford to lose, as no tip is guaranteed to win. You must be 18 or over to bet, and free, confidential support is available from \u003Ca href=\"https://www.gamcare.org.uk\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GamCare\u003C/a> and \u003Ca href=\"https://www.begambleaware.org\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">BeGambleAware\u003C/a>.\u003C/p>",{"title":165,"sections_content":166},"How to Choose Rugby Union Tips to Back","\u003Cp>Every Rugby Union tip on this page comes from an OLBG tipster and is recorded, so you can judge a prediction on its merits before you back it. Read the comments alongside each selection to see the reasoning behind the tip, then decide whether you agree with it.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>The tips table gives you more to go on. The percentage of tips on a selection shows how much support it has among our tipsters, and the value rating compares the odds with that level of support to highlight potential value. Look out for tips from our Experts too: these are OLBG tipsters with high strike rates, or strong current-month or six-month profit, in Rugby Union.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>If you would rather start with the tipsters themselves, our \u003Ca href=\"/best-tipsters/Rugby_Union/9\">Best Rugby Union Tipsters\u003C/a> page ranks them by profit and strike rate, with their available tips alongside. Their stats are tracked over twelve months.\u003C/p>",{"title":168,"sections_content":169},"Building a Rugby Union Accumulator from Our Tips","\u003Cp>An accumulator (or acca) combines several selections into one bet, but every leg has to win for it to pay out, so OLBG's tipsters typically back win singles instead.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>If you would still like a fun bet, and only stake what you can afford to lose, you could build a Rugby Union acca from several teams to win in the tips on this page.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>To make this easy, click \u003Cstrong>Add\u003C/strong> next to the tips on this page and the selections go into your betslip. You can also add \u003Ca href=\"/betting-tips/Rugby_League/10\">Rugby League tips\u003C/a> or \u003Ca href=\"/betting-tips\">tips from other sports\u003C/a> before you finalise your acca.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>Before you place your bet, compare odds from a range of UK-licensed bookmakers. Our guide to \u003Ca href=\"/bookmakers/articles/best-bookmakers-for-rugby-betting\">Rugby betting sites\u003C/a> is a good place to start. Then choose your bookmaker from the betslip, and your selections carry over, so you don't need to enter them again.\u003C/p>",{"title":171,"sections_content":172},"Rugby Union Betting Stats: Premiership, Top 14, Super Rugby and URC","\u003Cp>These Rugby Union betting stats compare the Premiership, Top 14, Super Rugby Pacific and United Rugby Championship (URC) across the last five completed seasons. The figures come from OLBG's own database of results and historical match odds, and show how often favourites win, how much home advantage matters and how many points matches produce.\u003C/p>\u003Ch3>How the Competitions Compare\u003C/h3>\u003Ctable class=\"table no-branding\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\u003Cthead>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"col\">Statistic\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\">Premiership\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\">Top 14\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\">Super Rugby\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\">URC\u003C/th>\u003C/tr>\u003C/thead>\u003Ctbody>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Matches analysed\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>540\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>910\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>406\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>720\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Home win\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>64.1%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>74.4%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>59.6%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>64.4%\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Away win\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>34.1%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>23.3%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>38.4%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>32.9%\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Level after 80 minutes\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>1.9%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>2.3%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>2.0%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>2.6%\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Favourite win\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>72.9%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>75.8%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>75.1%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>75.3%\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Underdog win\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>25.3%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>21.9%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>22.9%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>22.1%\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Favourite is the home side\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>72.9%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>89.2%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>62.6%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>70.4%\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Average total points\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>54.0\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>49.7\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>56.1\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>48.9\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Average winning margin\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>15.2\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>14.6\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>16.0\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>14.8\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Decided by 1 to 7 points\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>36.7%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>38.6%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>34.7%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>36.5%\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003C/tbody>\u003C/table>\u003Ch3>Favourites by Price Band\u003C/h3>\u003Cp>Here is how often the pre-match favourite won, grouped by the favourite's historical decimal price.\u003C/p>\u003Ctable class=\"table no-branding\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\u003Cthead>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"col\">Favourite's price\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\">Premiership\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\">Top 14\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\">Super Rugby\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\">URC\u003C/th>\u003C/tr>\u003C/thead>\u003Ctbody>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Under 1.10\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>95.5% (67)\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>92.4% (144)\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>89.5% (86)\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>96.6% (145)\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>1.10 to 1.29\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>79.6% (147)\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>85.2% (310)\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>80.2% (121)\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>78.9% (209)\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>1.30 to 1.49\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>71.4% (133)\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>70.5% (241)\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>73.2% (97)\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>73.3% (176)\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>1.50 to 1.69\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>59.6% (109)\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>61.7% (128)\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>58.7% (63)\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>56.8% (111)\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>1.70 and over\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>62.2% (82)\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>50.0% (86)\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>59.0% (39)\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>57.0% (79)\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003C/tbody>\u003C/table>\u003Cp>Figures in brackets show the number of matches in each price band.\u003C/p>\u003Ch3>Total Points\u003C/h3>\u003Ctable class=\"table no-branding\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\u003Cthead>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"col\">Total points\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\">Premiership\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\">Top 14\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\">Super Rugby\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\">URC\u003C/th>\u003C/tr>\u003C/thead>\u003Ctbody>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Under 40\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>21.1%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>26.2%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>13.5%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>27.8%\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>40 to 49\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>18.5%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>27.7%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>20.4%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>25.8%\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>50 to 59\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>24.8%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>22.3%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>27.6%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>23.3%\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>60 or more\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>35.6%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>23.8%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>38.4%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>23.1%\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Average\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>54.0\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>49.7\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>56.1\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>48.9\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Median\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>54\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>48\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>56\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>48\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003C/tbody>\u003C/table>\u003Ch3>Average Total Points by Season\u003C/h3>\u003Ctable class=\"table no-branding\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\u003Cthead>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"col\">Season\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\">Premiership\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\">Top 14\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\">Super Rugby\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\">URC\u003C/th>\u003C/tr>\u003C/thead>\u003Ctbody>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>2021-22 (Super Rugby 2022)\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>51.7\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>44.5\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>53.1\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>47.8\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>2022-23 (Super Rugby 2023)\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>52.8\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>46.3\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>59.0\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>52.4\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>2023-24 (Super Rugby 2024)\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>51.9\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>47.9\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>53.5\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>48.3\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>2024-25 (Super Rugby 2025)\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>56.3\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>51.1\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>57.7\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>48.3\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>2025-26 (Super Rugby 2026)\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>59.1\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>58.7\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>57.4\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>47.5\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003C/tbody>\u003C/table>\u003Ch3>Winning Margins\u003C/h3>\u003Ctable class=\"table no-branding\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\u003Cthead>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"col\">Winning margin\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\">Premiership\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\">Top 14\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\">Super Rugby\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\">URC\u003C/th>\u003C/tr>\u003C/thead>\u003Ctbody>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Level after 80 minutes\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>1.9%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>2.3%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>2.0%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>2.6%\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>1 to 7 points\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>36.7%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>38.6%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>34.7%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>36.5%\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>8 to 14 points\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>19.8%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>18.2%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>18.0%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>19.3%\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>15 to 21 points\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>17.8%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>16.0%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>17.7%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>16.5%\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>22 points or more\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>23.9%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>24.8%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>27.6%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>25.0%\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003C/tbody>\u003C/table>\u003Cp>Stats cover regular-season matches from the last five completed seasons: Premiership, Top 14 and URC from 2021-22 to 2025-26, and Super Rugby Pacific from 2022 to 2026. Results use the score after 80 minutes, so Super Rugby matches settled in extra time count as level. Matches with no clear favourite are left out of the favourite and price-band figures. Club numbers changed during the period (Premiership 13 to 10, Super Rugby 12 to 11), so seasons are not like for like. Last updated: 17 October 2026.\u003C/p>",{"title":174,"sections_content":175},"Rugby Union Preview Blogs and Betting Guides","\u003Cp>Read our in-depth previews and betting guides before you back the Rugby Union tips and predictions above.\u003C/p>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Ca href=\"/blogs/six-nations-betting-preview\">Six Nations Betting Preview\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Ca href=\"/blogs/rugby-union-world-cup-betting-guide\">Rugby World Cup Betting Guide\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Ca href=\"/blogs/european-champions-cup-preview-betting-guide\">European Champions Cup Preview and Betting Guide\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Ca href=\"/blogs/european-challenge-cup-preview-betting-guide\">European Challenge Cup Preview and Betting Guide\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Ca href=\"/blogs/top-14-preview-betting-guide\">Top 14 Preview and Betting Guide (Inc. Pro D2)\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Ca href=\"/blogs/premiership-rugby-preview-betting-guide\">Gallagher Premiership Preview and Betting Guide (Inc. Premiership Cup)\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Ca href=\"/blogs/united-rugby-championship-preview-betting-guide\">United Rugby Championship Preview and Betting Guide\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Ca href=\"/blogs/super-rugby-preview-betting-guide\">Super Rugby Pacific Preview and Betting Guide\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Ca href=\"/blogs/currie-cup-preview-betting-guide\">Currie Cup Preview and Betting Guide\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>",{"title":177,"sections_content":178},"Rugby Union Content: Meet the Author and Editor","\u003Cp>The Rugby Union content on this page, including our previews and betting guides, is written by Luke Bradshaw Lee and edited by Darren Brett. The tips themselves come from OLBG's tipsters.\u003C/p>\u003Cdiv class=\"author-box-component mb-8 p-6 bg-olbg-light-blue rounded-md items-center md:items-start justify-center md:justify-start flex flex-col md:flex-row color-bleu  compact\">\u003Ca class=\"rounded-full flex justify-center items-center overflow-hidden w-24 h-24 mb-6 md:mr-6 border-[6px] border-gray-500 border-opacity-25 image-outside\" href=\"/meet-the-experts/luke-bradshaw-lee\">\u003Cpicture>\u003Csource srcset=\"https://olbgimages.co.uk/image-cache?src=https://olbgimages.co.uk/storage/gallery/october-app/uploads/public/649/eca/4c4/649eca4c4e5c2098785434.jpeg&amp;w=80&amp;h=80&amp;zc=1\" media=\"(max-width: 1023px)\"> \u003Csource srcset=\"https://olbgimages.co.uk/image-cache?src=https://olbgimages.co.uk/storage/gallery/october-app/uploads/public/649/eca/4c4/649eca4c4e5c2098785434.jpeg&amp;w=100&amp;h=100&amp;zc=1\" media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\"> \u003Cimg alt=\"Luke Bradshaw Lee\" src=\"https://olbgimages.co.uk/image-cache?src=https://olbgimages.co.uk/storage/gallery/october-app/uploads/public/649/eca/4c4/649eca4c4e5c2098785434.jpeg&amp;w=80&amp;h=80&amp;zc=1\" title=\"Luke Bradshaw Lee\" class=\"w-full h-auto\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" loading=\"lazy\">\u003C/picture>\u003C/a> \u003Cdiv class=\"flex flex-col flex-1 items-center text-center md:items-start md:text-left\">\u003Cp class=\"text-xl font-bold\">About the author\u003C/p>  \u003Cdiv class=\"mb-2\">Luke Bradshaw Lee writes OLBG's Rugby Union and Rugby League content, including the preview and betting guides for the main competitions. He has more than a decade of experience writing about sports betting, having led betting content at Covers, and his work has appeared in The Independent and The Guardian.\u003C/div> \u003Cp class=\"mb-0 author-box-info\">- \u003Ca class=\"font-bold underline text-olbg-blue-gray hover:text-olbg-orange\" href=\"/meet-the-experts/luke-bradshaw-lee\">Luke Bradshaw Lee\u003C/a>, - Your Sports Betting Sites 👍\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"author-box-component mb-8 p-6 bg-[#414a5e] text-white rounded-md items-center md:items-start justify-center md:justify-start flex flex-col md:flex-row color-dark  compact\">\u003Ca class=\"rounded-full flex justify-center items-center overflow-hidden w-24 h-24 mb-6 md:mr-6 border-[6px] border-gray-500 border-opacity-25 image-outside\" href=\"/meet-the-experts/darren-brett\">\u003Cpicture>\u003Csource srcset=\"https://olbgimages.co.uk/image-cache?src=https://olbgimages.co.uk/storage/gallery/october-app/uploads/public/649/ec7/564/649ec7564fbfa346637961.jpeg&amp;w=80&amp;h=80&amp;zc=1\" media=\"(max-width: 1023px)\"> \u003Csource srcset=\"https://olbgimages.co.uk/image-cache?src=https://olbgimages.co.uk/storage/gallery/october-app/uploads/public/649/ec7/564/649ec7564fbfa346637961.jpeg&amp;w=100&amp;h=100&amp;zc=1\" media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\"> \u003Cimg alt=\"Darren Brett\" src=\"https://olbgimages.co.uk/image-cache?src=https://olbgimages.co.uk/storage/gallery/october-app/uploads/public/649/ec7/564/649ec7564fbfa346637961.jpeg&amp;w=80&amp;h=80&amp;zc=1\" title=\"Darren Brett\" class=\"w-full h-auto\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" loading=\"lazy\">\u003C/picture>\u003C/a> \u003Cdiv class=\"flex flex-col flex-1 items-center text-center md:items-start md:text-left\">\u003Cp class=\"text-xl font-bold\">About the editor\u003C/p>  \u003Cdiv class=\"mb-2\">Darren Brett is OLBG's content editor for rugby. He reviews the page content and preview guides for accuracy and currency, and keeps them updated as competitions and formats change.\u003C/div> \u003Cp class=\"mb-0 author-box-info\">- \u003Ca class=\"font-bold underline text-olbg-blue-gray hover:text-olbg-orange\" href=\"/meet-the-experts/darren-brett\">Darren Brett\u003C/a>, Content Editor\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>",{"title":180,"sections_content":181},"Rugby Union Betting Tips FAQ","\u003Cdiv>\u003Cheader class=\"sct-hdr  \">\u003Ch3 class=\"text-2xl\">\u003Ci class=\"text-2xl i-ui-faq text-olbg-orange\">\u003C/i> FAQ\u003C/h3> \u003Cp class=\"mb-2 text-gray-400 tagline\">Rugby Union Betting Tips FAQ\u003C/p>\u003C/header> \u003Cdiv class=\"faq\">\u003Cdiv class=\"flex flex-col gap-0 sm:gap-3 sm:flex-row fq-cnt\">\u003Cul class=\"flex-1 [&amp;&amp;]:p-0 [&amp;&amp;]:m-0 h-rst-ls\">\u003Cli data-faq-card=\"\" class=\"group p-2 px-3 [&amp;&amp;]:mb-3 hover:bg-[#fff6e8] hover:cursor-pointer list-none bg-white border rounded border-c-border-2 shadow-sm faq-crd\" data-num=\"1\">\u003Ch4 class=\"p-0 m-0\">\u003Cbutton type=\"button\" data-faq-toggle=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center w-full p-0 m-0 text text-left bg-transparent border-0 qa-title\">\u003Cspan class=\"flex-1 max-md:!text-md max-md:leading-relaxed max-md:pr-10 md:!text-base\">Are the Rugby Union tips on OLBG free?\u003C/span> \u003Ci class=\"i-ui-dropdown-arrow text-olbg-orange group-[.card-opened]:-rotate-90 text-xs\">\u003C/i>\u003C/button>\u003C/h4> \u003Cdiv class=\"hidden group-[.card-opened]:block pb-0 mt-2 mb-0 answer\">\u003Cp>Yes. You can view all of the Rugby Union tips and predictions on this page for free, covering today's and upcoming matches. You must be 18 or over to place a bet.\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/li>\u003Cli data-faq-card=\"\" class=\"group p-2 px-3 [&amp;&amp;]:mb-3 hover:bg-[#fff6e8] hover:cursor-pointer list-none bg-white border rounded border-c-border-2 shadow-sm faq-crd\" data-num=\"2\">\u003Ch4 class=\"p-0 m-0\">\u003Cbutton type=\"button\" data-faq-toggle=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center w-full p-0 m-0 text text-left bg-transparent border-0 qa-title\">\u003Cspan class=\"flex-1 max-md:!text-md max-md:leading-relaxed max-md:pr-10 md:!text-base\">What Rugby Union betting markets do your tips cover?\u003C/span> \u003Ci class=\"i-ui-dropdown-arrow text-olbg-orange group-[.card-opened]:-rotate-90 text-xs\">\u003C/i>\u003C/button>\u003C/h4> \u003Cdiv class=\"hidden group-[.card-opened]:block pb-0 mt-2 mb-0 answer\">\u003Cp>Our tipsters post match-winner and handicap selections for individual matches, along with ante-post tips on tournament winners, such as the Six Nations. Each tip shows the market, the selection and the tipster's comments, so you can see the reasoning behind it.\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/li>\u003Cli data-faq-card=\"\" class=\"group p-2 px-3 [&amp;&amp;]:mb-3 hover:bg-[#fff6e8] hover:cursor-pointer list-none bg-white border rounded border-c-border-2 shadow-sm faq-crd\" data-num=\"3\">\u003Ch4 class=\"p-0 m-0\">\u003Cbutton type=\"button\" data-faq-toggle=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center w-full p-0 m-0 text text-left bg-transparent border-0 qa-title\">\u003Cspan class=\"flex-1 max-md:!text-md max-md:leading-relaxed max-md:pr-10 md:!text-base\">What does a handicap bet mean in Rugby Union?\u003C/span> \u003Ci class=\"i-ui-dropdown-arrow text-olbg-orange group-[.card-opened]:-rotate-90 text-xs\">\u003C/i>\u003C/button>\u003C/h4> \u003Cdiv class=\"hidden group-[.card-opened]:block pb-0 mt-2 mb-0 answer\">\u003Cp>A handicap gives one team a points head start to even up the contest. For example, a team tipped at +10.5 wins the bet if it wins the match or loses by 10 points or fewer. A team tipped at -8.5 has to win by 9 points or more. The half point means the bet can't be settled as a push.\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>\u003Cul class=\"flex-1 [&amp;&amp;]:p-0 [&amp;&amp;]:m-0 h-rst-ls\">\u003Cli data-faq-card=\"\" class=\"group p-2 px-3 [&amp;&amp;]:mb-3 hover:bg-[#fff6e8] hover:cursor-pointer list-none bg-white border rounded border-c-border-2 shadow-sm faq-crd\" data-num=\"1\">\u003Ch4 class=\"p-0 m-0\">\u003Cbutton type=\"button\" data-faq-toggle=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center w-full p-0 m-0 text text-left bg-transparent border-0 qa-title\">\u003Cspan class=\"flex-1 max-md:!text-md max-md:leading-relaxed max-md:pr-10 md:!text-base\">How often do favourites win in Rugby Union?\u003C/span> \u003Ci class=\"i-ui-dropdown-arrow text-olbg-orange group-[.card-opened]:-rotate-90 text-xs\">\u003C/i>\u003C/button>\u003C/h4> \u003Cdiv class=\"hidden group-[.card-opened]:block pb-0 mt-2 mb-0 answer\">\u003Cp>Across the Premiership, Top 14, Super Rugby Pacific and United Rugby Championship, the pre-match favourite won between 72.9% and 75.8% of regular-season matches over the last five completed seasons. Underdogs won most of the rest, and around 2% of matches were level after 80 minutes. See our \u003Ca href=\"#rugby-union-betting-stats-premiership-top-14-super-rugby-and-urc\">Rugby Union betting stats\u003C/a> for the full comparison, including how favourites perform by price band. These figures come from OLBG's own database of results and historical match odds.\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/li>\u003Cli data-faq-card=\"\" class=\"group p-2 px-3 [&amp;&amp;]:mb-3 hover:bg-[#fff6e8] hover:cursor-pointer list-none bg-white border rounded border-c-border-2 shadow-sm faq-crd\" data-num=\"2\">\u003Ch4 class=\"p-0 m-0\">\u003Cbutton type=\"button\" data-faq-toggle=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center w-full p-0 m-0 text text-left bg-transparent border-0 qa-title\">\u003Cspan class=\"flex-1 max-md:!text-md max-md:leading-relaxed max-md:pr-10 md:!text-base\">Can I see past Rugby Union tips?\u003C/span> \u003Ci class=\"i-ui-dropdown-arrow text-olbg-orange group-[.card-opened]:-rotate-90 text-xs\">\u003C/i>\u003C/button>\u003C/h4> \u003Cdiv class=\"hidden group-[.card-opened]:block pb-0 mt-2 mb-0 answer\">\u003Cp>For recent matches, yes. Use the Show Expired Events button above the tips table to see tips for matches played in the last 24 hours. For older tips, each tipster's profile lists the tips they have made over the last 35 days.\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/li>\u003Cli data-faq-card=\"\" class=\"group p-2 px-3 [&amp;&amp;]:mb-3 hover:bg-[#fff6e8] hover:cursor-pointer list-none bg-white border rounded border-c-border-2 shadow-sm faq-crd\" data-num=\"3\">\u003Ch4 class=\"p-0 m-0\">\u003Cbutton type=\"button\" data-faq-toggle=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center w-full p-0 m-0 text text-left bg-transparent border-0 qa-title\">\u003Cspan class=\"flex-1 max-md:!text-md max-md:leading-relaxed max-md:pr-10 md:!text-base\">What happens to a Rugby Union bet if the match is drawn or goes to extra time?\u003C/span> \u003Ci class=\"i-ui-dropdown-arrow text-olbg-orange group-[.card-opened]:-rotate-90 text-xs\">\u003C/i>\u003C/button>\u003C/h4> \u003Cdiv class=\"hidden group-[.card-opened]:block pb-0 mt-2 mb-0 answer\">\u003Cp>It depends on the bookmaker's rules, so always check the terms before you bet. Match winner bets are often settled on the result after 80 minutes, which means a draw loses a bet on either team. Draws are rare, at around 2% to 2.6% of regular-season matches in the Premiership, Top 14, Super Rugby Pacific and URC, but some competitions, including Super Rugby Pacific, use extra time in certain matches.\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div> \u003Cdiv>\u